  "label": "User projected onto the textual dialogue as the speaker 'her'",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the woman (visual entity) who is labeled as 'her' in the top text overlay. The deictic pronoun 'her' explicitly directs the user's identification with the woman as the speaker in the dialogue. The user sees themselves as the woman speaking the line 'i thought you liked me talking shit in bed!' and is thus projected onto the visual material of the woman and the textual material of text_chunk_1.",
